==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-expedient.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la}} ''expediens'' (stem ''expedient-),'' present participle of '''[[expedire]]''' “to [[expedite]].”

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[simple|Simple]], [[easy]], or [[quick]]; [[convenient]].
#: ''Most people, faced with a decision, will choose the most '''expedient''' option.''

====Translations====
{{trans-top|simple, easy, or quick; convenient}}
